{"id":"claim:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates--koyaykus-disabled-cannot","revision":1,"topic":"topic:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates","topics":["topic:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates","topic:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates--ability"],"statement":{"en":"The negative auxiliary koyaykus means 'be disabled and cannot do'.","ja":"否定助動詞 koyaykus は「支障があって〜できない」を意味する。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"universal","modality":"categorical","conditions":[]},"forms":["koyaykus"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0204-07","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T08-31-28-856Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates--nukuri-no-strength","revision":1,"topic":"topic:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates","topics":["topic:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates","topic:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates--ability"],"statement":{"en":"The negative auxiliary nukuri means 'not have the strength to do'.","ja":"否定助動詞 nukuri は「〜する気力・体力がない」を意味する。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"universal","modality":"categorical","conditions":[]},"forms":["nukuri"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0204-09","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T08-31-28-856Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates--suppletive-negative-predicates-exist","revision":1,"topic":"topic:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates","topics":["topic:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates","topic:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates--class"],"statement":{"en":"Some lexical predicates have inherently negative suppletive counterparts, such as eranpewtek for eramuan, eaykap for easkay, and isam for an.","ja":"一部の語彙的述語には固有の否定的対応形が存在し、eramuan に対する eranpewtek、easkay に対する eaykap、an に対する isam などがその例である。"},"type":"existence","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"existential","modality":"categorical","conditions":[]},"forms":["eramuan","eranpewtek","easkay","eaykap","an","isam"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0141-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[{"kind":"supports","claim":"claim:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates--somo-blocked-by-inherent-negatives","differs_in":null,"note":"The existence of inherently negative suppletive predicates motivates the blocking of somo with those forms."}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T08-31-28-856Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates--maka-not-like","revision":1,"topic":"topic:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates","topics":["topic:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates","topic:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates--limits"],"statement":{"en":"The negative auxiliary maka means 'not like to do (eat)'.","ja":"否定助動詞 maka は「〜する（食べる）のを好まない」を意味する。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"universal","modality":"categorical","conditions":[]},"forms":["maka"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0204-08","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T08-31-28-856Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates--somo-blocked-by-inherent-negatives","revision":1,"topic":"topic:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates","topics":["topic:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates","topic:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates--somo-interaction"],"statement":{"en":"A small number of verbs and verb auxiliaries possess inherently negative counterparts, and somo is never used with them.","ja":"少数の動詞および動詞助詞には対応する固有の否定形が存在し、それらに対して somo は決して用いられない。"},"type":"absence","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"universal","modality":"categorical","conditions":[]},"forms":["somo"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0132-09","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T08-31-28-856Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates--three-auxiliaries-also-independent-with-ka","revision":1,"topic":"topic:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates","topics":["topic:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates","topic:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates--syntax"],"statement":{"en":"Three negative auxiliaries (eramiskari, etoranne, oripak) may also function as independent verbs and may occasionally have ka interpolated between the main verb and the auxiliary.","ja":"否定助動詞のうち3語（eramiskari、etoranne、oripak）は自立動詞としても機能し得て、本動詞と助動詞の間に ka が挿入されることがある。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"existential","modality":"possibility","conditions":[]},"forms":["eramiskari","etoranne","oripak","ka"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0204-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[{"kind":"contrasts","claim":"claim:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates--koyaykus-maka-nukuri-auxiliary-only-no-ka","differs_in":"scope","note":"The two claims partition the set of negative auxiliaries by their syntactic distribution: some allow ka and independent use, others do not."}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T08-31-28-856Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates--koyaykus-maka-nukuri-auxiliary-only-no-ka","revision":1,"topic":"topic:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates","topics":["topic:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates","topic:negation/negation-ability-cognition-predicates--syntax"],"statement":{"en":"The negative auxiliaries koyaykus, maka, and nukuri are found only as auxiliaries and never appear with the interpolated postposition ka.","ja":"否定助動詞 koyaykus、maka、nukuri は助動詞としてのみ現れ、後置詞 ka が挿入されて現れることは決してない。"},"type":"absence","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"universal","modality":"categorical","conditions":[]},"forms":["koyaykus","maka","nukuri","ka"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0204-06","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T08-31-28-856Z","status":"grouped"}
